Practice problems covering all skills in the lesson:

* Simplify quotients of powers with multiple variables and coefficients.
* Simplify expressions with negative coefficients and negative exponents.
* Evaluate real-world problems involving decibels and relative loudness, computer memory units (bytes, kilobytes, megabytes), and geometric measurements.
